%%{init: {"sequence": {"noteAlign": "left", "mirrorActors": false}} }%%
%% docs/diagrams/scenario-s3.mermaid
%% S3: Host -> S3 (landing) -> Aggregator -> S3 (final)
%% PLAN.md §2 (scenario table), §5.1 (timestamps), §5.2 (derivation).
sequenceDiagram
    participant generator as Generator
    participant agent as Agent: Vector or Cribl Edge
    participant landing as Landing S3: llt-landing-vagg-{acct} / llt-landing-cs-{acct}
    participant sqs as SQS: llt-landing-vagg-q / llt-landing-cs-q
    participant T1 as Aggregator T1: S3 source, SQS-driven
    participant final as Final S3: llt-final-{acct}

    generator->>generator: write event file<br/>t_gen_ns (generation time)
    generator->>agent: event file (local read)
    Note over agent: hop_ts.agent captured here —<br/>BEFORE any egress (incl. this S3 landing write)
    agent->>landing: S3 PutObject via sender<br/>S3 gateway endpoint (cross-account)<br/>batch 5s / 10MB
    Note over landing: landing PutObject time captured<br/>(x-amz-meta-llt-put-ms preferred,<br/>LastModified fallback — fallback operative)
    landing->>sqs: S3 event notification<br/>ObjectCreated:*
    sqs->>T1: long-poll consume<br/>(event-driven pickup)
    Note over T1: hop_ts.agg1 captured here<br/>(VRL remap / Cribl Eval on receive<br/>from S3 source)
    T1->>final: S3 sink PutObject<br/>batch 5s / 10MB
    Note over final: final PutObject time captured<br/>(x-amz-meta-llt-put-ms preferred,<br/>LastModified fallback — fallback operative)

    Note over generator,final: Derivations (PLAN §5.2):<br/>gen→agent = hop_ts.agent − t_gen<br/>agent→landing = landingPut − hop_ts.agent<br/>landing→T1 = hop_ts.agg1 − landingPut<br/>T1→final = finalPut − hop_ts.agg1<br/>e2e = finalPut − t_gen<br/>raw e2e includes 2 × 5s batch flush — see measurement.mermaid
